+# TodoMVC - Vanilla JavaScript
+
+A TodoMVC implementation using vanilla JavaScript with no preprocessors.
+
+## Features
+
+- Add, edit, and delete todos
+- Mark todos as complete
+- Filter todos by All, Active, and Completed
+- Clear completed todos
+- Persistent storage using localStorage
+- Responsive design
+
+## Implementation
+
+This app is built with pure HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. It uses:
+
+- **HTML5** for structure
+- **CSS3** for styling (using TodoMVC CSS libraries)
+- **Vanilla JavaScript** for functionality
+- **localStorage** for data persistence
+
+## File Structure
+
+```
+index.html          - Main HTML file
+css/
+  app.css           - Custom styles
+js/
+  app.js            - Main application logic
+node_modules/
+  todomvc-common/   - Common TodoMVC utilities
+  todomvc-app-css/  - TodoMVC CSS styles
+```
+
+## How to Run
+
+1. Open `index.html` in a web browser
+2. No build process required - it's ready to run
+
+## Browser Support
+
+- Chrome (latest)
+- Firefox (latest)
+- Safari (latest)
+- Edge (latest)
+
+## Data Persistence
+
+Todos are stored in `localStorage` with the key `todos-vanillajs`. Each todo has:
+- `id`: Unique identifier
+- `title`: Todo text
+- `completed`: Boolean status
+
+## Features Implemented
+
+- [x] Add new todos
+- [x] Edit todos (double-click)
+- [x] Delete todos
+- [x] Mark as complete
+- [x] Mark all as complete
+- [x] Filter by All/Active/Completed
+- [x] Clear completed
+- [x] Counter of items left
+- [x] Responsive design
+- [x] Data persistence
+- [x] Keyboard navigation
